{"synopsis":"Di masa kekacauan Demon King melintasi 665 alam sebelum menyerang alam manusia\nPahlawan pemberani lah yang menghentikan perang tersebut\nBerkat pengorbanan hebat mereka umat manusia pun berhasil bertahan hidup\nNamun hal tersebut mengarah pada munculnya Demon King yang baru\nDia adalah Demiourgos Demon King yang ke666\nAku berhenti menjadi Demon King katanya sebelum meninggalkan alam iblis\nIni adalah kisah tentang Demon King yang melarikan diri dan seorang pahlawan yang menjadi bawahannya\nMengapa dirinya berhenti menjadi Demon King","alternative_title":"마왕을 그만둔 이유","author":"Lee Sang-Hyuk","artist":"","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"285e0ec1-3f89-4f33-bc8b-ed30d9e70de8","number":"37","chapter":"37","title":"","date":"2024-12-31","released":"2024-12-31"},{"chapter_id":"d51ed614-4a29-4de0-bfa7-e683dc554537","number":"36","chapter":"36","title":"","date":"2024-12-31","released":"2024-12-31"},{"chapter_id":"41194cf7-7e95-46b8-8efe-f04b08d7d02f","number":"35","chapter":"35","title":"","date":"2024-12-31","released":"2024-12-31"},{"chapter_id":"16cbfb47-bbf0-4e0b-9d8f-fa745cea313b","number":"34","chapter":"34","title":"","date":"2024-12-31","released":"2024-12-31"},{"chapter_id":"56054db5-3ef6-4ee2-b104-51ec59799002","number":"33","chapter":"33","title":"","date":"2024-12-31","released":"2024-12-31"},{"chapter_id":"b278d98c-7f55-418f-a90e-b8e86b43619a","number":"32","chapter":"32","title":"","date":"2024-12-31","released":"2024-12-31"},{"chapter_id":"29512a7f-7c18-488f-acb0-6c10329bab14","number":"31","chapter":"31","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"56b5bbb2-db4b-4c75-adf3-f8baccbc2e5d","number":"30","chapter":"30","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"4c423d60-914f-4e4f-a74f-00411f9a39f7","number":"29","chapter":"29","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"35c23a69-34bf-4366-92a0-19503f11e08a","number":"28","chapter":"28","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","release